      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOLLYWOOD HOGAN (4) continues to race in super honest form, hitting the frame two times on end before scoring an overdue win last time out (19.82) at Capalaba. Strike rate this course strong having won two of three tries. Super consistent and looks a key player. LUNA ART (1) is worth forgiving last start after finishing fourth (24.08) from Box 5 at Rockhampton over 407m. Has a strong record from box 1, including three wins. Should be about the money. ANOTHER SCRUB (8) missed the frame last time at Q Parklands but just three runs back flew around 407m at Rockhampton in 23.69. Should be in this for a long way. KAIRANGA (7) was well backed last start but ran below expectations when seventh (22.51), beaten 6 lengths.",
